{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_ai_handoff_current_handoff", "label": "Current Handoff", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Entry point for maintenance: current version, last validation and immediate open live checks only."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_m7_dragon_helper", "label": "M7 Dragon Helper", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Colored spawn points, estimated statue outlines and evidence-based local count notifications; gray/green/red outlines track a received origin against community bounds and do not promise the exact server range."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_beng114_account_guard", "label": "Beng114 Account Guard", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "After a visibility report the whole helper became Beng114-only in both settings menus and at runtime, guarded by local session UUID, because the original restriction covered only Developer Diagnostics and a copied enabled config leaked it to other accounts."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_blood_rush_completion_guard", "label": "Blood Rush Completion Guard", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Completion now stops every automatic progress title and cancels a pending initial title, because the old guard only covered the zero-remaining branch and delayed Wither scans still emitted remaining-door titles after Blood open."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_trap_map_palette_fallback", "label": "Trap Map Palette Fallback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A bounded interior majority of exact orange palette value 62 confirms a generic Trap label without catalog learning; known identity still wins and normal-room color 63 is rejected."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_missing_mode_after_failed_warp", "label": "Missing Mode After a Failed Warp", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Splits retain the phase layout separately from confirmed mode so common boss dialogue cannot promote a default masterMode=false into a confirmed F7 and produce false PB labels, comparisons and saves."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_score_discrepancy_investigation", "label": "Unresolved Score Bonus Gap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Repeated Kung-versus-server score gaps trace to missing bonus inputs; diagnostics were widened but no formula or flag was changed because the evidence never identified a lost report."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_skyblocker_secret_sync_bridge", "label": "Skyblocker Secret Sync Bridge", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An optional event-only mixin forwards Skyblocker's accepted Mimic/Prince/Bat callbacks through the existing lifecycle/workload gates and per-run flags, without announcements or inferred contributor credit."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_unique_partial_room_completion", "label": "Unique Partial Room Completion", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prediction now completes every uniquely implied unseen cell including two missing cells of a 2x2 or 1x4; the old output filter allowed exactly one missing cell although candidate matching already supported more."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_automatic_modrinth_updates", "label": "Automatic Modrinth Updates", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The blanket brand/IPC guard was removed so Updates: Available downloads, verifies and queues atomic replacement after Minecraft exits in every launcher, while size, hashes, dependency validation, path confinement, backup and session locks remain."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_split_prediction_source", "label": "Split Prediction Source PB or AVG", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Splits > Time Prediction picks PB (default) or AVG, where AVG means each phase's mean over up to 20 confirmed finished runs per floor/mode with aborted and manual runs excluded."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_evidence_over_inference", "label": "Evidence over Inference Principle", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nothing is invented from a suggestive signal: missing evidence stays unknown, no hash or secret count is guessed, and passing unit tests never count as proof of live play."}, {"id": "docs_ai_handoff_built_not_installed", "label": "Built, Not Installed", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/AI_HANDOFF.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every validation reports a rebuilt JAR that was deliberately not installed into a game 